==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Dark Trousers are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and they are obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Fire Hazards]]". Unlike most pieces of Attire, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].
